        ]
      ],
      "text": "📌 30秒速记｜中位数先排序；众数看谁出现最多；百分位数就是“有大约多少比例的数据不超过这个位置”。",
      "sourceIndex": 2483
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固题｜需要时再做",
      "style": "Heading3",
      "sourceIndex": 2484
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 1,2,2,5众数。",
      "style": "",
      "sourceIndex": 2485
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 1,4,7极差。",
      "style": "",
      "sourceIndex": 2486
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 1,2,3,4中位数。",
      "style": "",
      "sourceIndex": 2487
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 百分位数计算第一步。",
      "style": "",
      "sourceIndex": 2488
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 第75百分位数大意。",
      "style": "",
      "sourceIndex": 2489
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1.2；2.6；3.2.5；4.排序；5.约75%的数据不超过该值",
      "style": "TinyNote",
      "sourceIndex": 2490
    },
